  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Chocolate Waffles.png|left|184x184px|Chocolate Waffles]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 117\n |price = 1 to 637\n |time = 40 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|wafflem|bigger|link=Waffle Maker}}\n |xp = 76\n |base = 177\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 34 min\n}}\n'''Chocolate Waffles''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 117. It was added in May 2023.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making Chocolate Waffles'''===\n[[File:Waffle Maker.png|150px|left|Waffle Maker]]\nChocolate Waffle are made in the [[Waffle Maker]].\n\nTo make chocolate waffles, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Plain Waffles.png|75px|Plain Waffles|link=Plain Waffles]]\n|[[File:Cacao.png|75px|Cacao|link=Cacao]]\n|[[File:Strawberry.png|75px|Strawberry|link=Strawberry]]\n|[[File:Banana.png|75px|Banana|link=Banana]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 40 minutes to make chocolate waffles, and 34 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] machine. Each unit gives players 76 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling chocolate waffles'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Chocolate waffles can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 6,372 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 units.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a berry waffles costs 570 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders require 1 chocolate waffles per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Schokoladenwaffeln\n|es = Gofres con chocolate\n|it = Waffle al cioccolato\n|nl = Chocoladewafels\n|no = Sjokoladevafler\n|ru = Шоколадные вафли\n}}\n[[pt-br:Waffles com frutinhas]]